    "detailed_description": "<strong>Anvillage</strong> is an RPG about crafting and exploring a fantasy world.<br>In Anvillage, you will be harvesting resources, collecting loot from enemies,<br>crafting items, and as well as building a village!<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2026300/extras/e5fe37b8351049a7fa3b74a4d053e74b.avif?t=1727827345\" /></div><br><br>Anvillage is a 2D Pixel-Art game where the player will interact with a fantasy world,<br>Bruce is a warrior wich is given a task to rebuild a village from scratch.<br>He will meet funny characters along his journey whom will help him in<br>his mission to rebuild Anvillage.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2026300/extras/b5fa3daa67f8f56a3ce7ed72b902b4c3.avif?t=1727827345\" /></div><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Crafting<br></li><li>Building<br></li><li>Turn based combat<br></li><li>Achievments<br></li><li>Cute small lore.<br></li><li>Resource Gathering<br></li><li>Inventory-System</li></ul><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2026300/extras/78d6e73dd19fc82a9bf37444d6b48652.avif?t=1727827345\" /></div>",
    "about_the_game": "<strong>Anvillage</strong> is an RPG about crafting and exploring a fantasy world.<br>In Anvillage, you will be harvesting resources, collecting loot from enemies,<br>crafting items, and as well as building a village!<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2026300/extras/e5fe37b8351049a7fa3b74a4d053e74b.avif?t=1727827345\" /></div><br><br>Anvillage is a 2D Pixel-Art game where the player will interact with a fantasy world,<br>Bruce is a warrior wich is given a task to rebuild a village from scratch.<br>He will meet funny characters along his journey whom will help him in<br>his mission to rebuild Anvillage.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2026300/extras/b5fa3daa67f8f56a3ce7ed72b902b4c3.avif?t=1727827345\" /></div><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Crafting<br></li><li>Building<br></li><li>Turn based combat<br></li><li>Achievments<br></li><li>Cute small lore.<br></li><li>Resource Gathering<br></li><li>Inventory-System</li></ul><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2026300/extras/78d6e73dd19fc82a9bf37444d6b48652.avif?t=1727827345\" /></div>",
    "short_description": "In Anvillage you are a knight that needs to build a village by harvesting woods and stones. You will also be building tons of buildings and crafting equipment and other items.",
